<title>USA: Northstar Computer FY96 operating net up.</title>
<headline>Northstar Computer FY96 operating net up.</headline>
<dateline>BROOKLYN PARK, Minn. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northstar Computer Forms Inc said its operating income for fiscal 1996, ended October 31, increased 24.8 percent over the same year-ago period.</p>
<p>However, it said net income declined 7.4 percent to $1.3 million from $1.4 million because of a $300,000 gain on the sale of land in 1995.</p>
<p>Northstar designs and manufactures business and financial forms.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
